{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S11（22秒）和S12（25秒）的纵向话句与感受仍然偏密，连续扫读时不如X的双栏分区轻松，容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然信息并不少，但重点话语通过放大加亮形成了明确的视觉入口，感受又按音乐节点出现，不必一次处理全部信息，因此更容易边听边抓住叙事。更重要的是，Y把怀念、自我辩解、孤独、对亲近的渴望和最终的自我选择连成了连续的心理过程，音乐描写也具体到了声音、动作、呼吸和身体反应，情绪转折比X更容易被实际感受到，而不只是读到几个情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6defffb2-6efc-458a-ae57-8e674e5000e0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T181928155921Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:20:57.447367+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "52f901090188e8556ca888b3e083088b3c9312e488a3ed283659b6e377b86f6e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen